    "title": "Scaling Intelligence: Modal x Gray Area AI Commissions",
    "description": "What happens when artists get access to compute at the scale industry runs on?\n\nScaling Intelligence: Modal x Gray Area AI Commissions opens Wednesday, October 28 at Gray Area. Thirteen artists debut new work built with AI and large-scale cloud computing, moving between scales that rarely meet: a satellite’s planetary view beside a microbial colony, the inside of a neural network opening onto forests and watersheds, a day of visitor conversation becoming a creature’s memory.\n\nRather than using AI to make more of the same, these artists treat it as a translation layer, letting intelligences of vastly different sizes and speeds sense one another.\n\n🌐 Opening Night\nWednesday, Oct 28, 7–10 PM\nRSVP: link in bio\n\n🕑 Exhibition Hours\nThu, Oct 29: 2–6 PM\nFri, Oct 30: 2–8 PM\nSat, Oct 31: 1–8 PM\nSun, Nov 1: 1–8 PM\nVisit: link in bio\n\n📍Gray Area, 2665 Mission St, San Francisco\nFree admission, donations welcome\n\nFeaturing\n@cezarmocan\n@colin_odonnell + @subfeels + Will Gardiner\n@prismspecs\n@ikovrigina\n@greenberg.ira\n@tinapulejkova\n@xmiguelnovelo\n@pkmital\n@rashedhaq\n@dirty.stray.dog\n@spence.r.chang\n\nPresented in partnership with modal.\n\n#ScalingIntelligence #GrayArea #AIArt #NewMediaArt #SanFrancisco",
