    "title": "Scaling Intelligence: Modal x Gray Area AI Commissions Opening Night",
    "description": "Scaling Intelligence: Modal x Gray Area AI Commissions opens NEXT Wednesday, October 28 at Gray Area.\n\n13 artists debut new work built with AI and large-scale cloud computing, moving between scales that rarely meet: a satellite’s planetary view beside a microbial colony, the inside of a neural network opening onto forests and watersheds, a day of visitor conversation becoming a creature’s memory.\n\nRather than using AI to make more of the same, these artists treat it as a translation layer, letting intelligences of vastly different sizes and speeds sense one another.\n\nSpencer Chang’s Free Agents reconnects us to the humanness within these AI systems and invites audiences to reflect on our relationship with them and how we want to define it moving forward.\n\nDrop in, play, and discover at opening night!\n\n🌐 Opening Night\nWednesday, Oct 28, 7-10 PM\nRSVP: link in bio\n\n🕑 Exhibition Hours\nThu, Oct 29: 2-6 PM\nFri, Oct 30: 2-8 PM\nSat, Oct 31: 1-8 PM\nSun, Nov 1: 1-8 PM\nVisit: link in bio\n\n📍Gray Area, 2665 Mission St, San Francisco\nFree admission, donations welcome",
