    "description": "🎃 Halloween is almost here, and “The Haunt” is around the corner! \n\nHere’s what folks are saying about it –\n\n“Love Halloween x DIY creativity x local art” – 2025 visitor \n\n“One of the Bay Area’s best fright attractions” – San Francisco Chronicle\n\n“YBCA is opening the door to new dimensions” – 7x7\n\n“This was a fun end to the Halloween season. I wish I had come to see this earlier!” – 2025 visitor\n\n“Took my partner because she loves art and crafts and Halloween—she loved it and I think all our friends would love it as well” – 2025 visitor\n\nGet ready for artist-made environments, tarot readings, spooky themed cocktails, and DJs selected by Lower Grand Radio to keep the vibes going. We’ll also be pouring selections from our neighbors at East Brother Beer Co (@eastbrotherbeer). \n\nWant to add a little creativity to your costume? We’ll have DIY Halloween headwear crafting stations each night (hosted with creative reuse center SCRAP on Friday, October 30).\n\nWe look forward to seeing you at this one-of-a-kind Halloween hangout Oct 29–31!\n\nPhotos by Jason Henry and Robbie Sweeny",
