    "title": "Lightscape",
    "description": "✨Lightscape returns this November to the San Francisco Botanical Garden in Golden Gate Park! This magical holiday light and sound experience for the whole family features dazzling displays throughout the plants, trees, and ponds, all set to music. Grab dinner, drinks, or snacks from the on-site food trucks, then explore the gardens after dark. \n 📅 Nightly, November 20–January 3 🕔 5–9 pm, last entry at 8:15 pm 🎟️ $32 and up adults, $20 and up youth 5–17, free for ages 0–4; flex tickets $49 and up. Advance tickets on sale now! 🍔 Food and drink available for purchase, including beer, wine, and cocktails 🚙 Street parking in Golden Gate Park 🚌 Accessible by Muni lines 44, N-Judah, 5R, and 28\n📍 San Francisco Botanical Garden, 1199 9th Ave, San Francisco, CA 94122 🖥️ gggp.org/lightscape 📲 @sfbotanicalgarden \n\n______________________________ ✨Holiday lights in San Francisco -Family-friendly holiday events in the Bay Area -Christmas lights & holiday light displays✨ -Things to do with kids in San Francisco -Bay Area holiday activities for families -Golden Gate Park holiday events -San Francisco Botanical Garden Lightscape\n\n#Lightscape #SanFranciscoKids #BayAreaKids #BayAreaHolidayFun",
