    "description": "Congratulations to our winner @mickeychrissy!\n✨ LOLA YOUNG GIVEAWAY ✨\n\nJust announced! Catch @lolayounggg at @billgrahamcivic on May 1, 2027 🫐 We’re giving away a pair of tickets to ONE LUCKY WINNER!\n\n🪩 How to enter:\n\n1️⃣ Like this post\n2️⃣ Follow @dothebay + @apeconcerts\n3️⃣ Tag your +1 in the comments (1 tag = 1 entry)\n\n👉 Winner will be selected on 10/12 and contacted by DoTheBay via DM.\n\n🎟️ Artist presale: Wednesday, 10/7 at 10am\n🪐 APE presale: Thursday, 10/8 at 10am\n🎫 Tickets on sale: Friday, 10/9 at 10am\n\n🔗 Sign up for the artist presale and get the code at the link in bio!\n\n#LolaYoung #SanFrancisco #BayArea #DoTheBay",
