    "title": "Tenderloin Street Fair: Día De Muertos Celebration 2026",
    "description": "💀🌼 TENDERLOIN STREET FAIR: DÍA DE MUERTOS | NOV. 1!\n\nThe Tenderloin comes alive for Día de Muertos with lucha libre 🤼, beautiful ofrendas🕯️, local food & retail vendors, a Kids Zone, face painting, live music ¡y mucho más!\n\n🎶 FREE LIVE MUSIC FROM MARIACHI TO PSYCHEDELIC CUMBIA!\n\n💃 Feel the salsa rhythms of @aguapuramama, get lost in the psychedelic Peruvian cumbia, chicha and tropical sounds of @combotezeta, and rock out with @soucanoband's Latin rock and soul!\n\n🇲🇽 Plus, música mexicana from @rica__montes__official, @bandalatoxica_, @mariachi_tradicion_mexicana and Trio Sol de México, with more cultural performances from @carnavalsf!\n\n📅 Sunday, Nov. 1 | 2–8 PM\n\n📍 Golden Gate Ave. between Larkin & Jones | SF\n\n✨ FREE + ALL AGES!\n\n🔗 RSVP for free at the link in bio!\n\nPresented by: @TLCBD and @IntoTheStreets, with support from @CivicJoyFund.\n\nCommunity Partners: @bilalmahmood, @carnavalsf, @clecha_sf, @lavozsf, @stanthonysf, @tenderloinhousingclinicsf, Tenderloin Community School and @uclaw_sf\n\n#dothebay #tenderloinsf #intothestreets",
